    needsLabel: THE NEEDS
    needs:
    - Complete student & license management
    - Flexible packages & pricing
    - Real-time multi-instructor scheduling
    - Instructor & fleet management
    - Belgian invoicing & payments
    challengesLabel: THE CHALLENGES
    challenge: '<p><strong>Isolated desktop software:</strong> The sector''s legacy solutions are Windows applications with no web or mobile access. No way to check the schedule or student records outside the office.</p><p><strong>Paper route sheets:</strong> Instructors fill out paper route sheets that then have to be re-entered manually — a source of errors and wasted time.</p><p><strong>Scheduling under pressure:</strong> A driving school with 10 instructors handles 80 to 120 lessons a day. Any slowness or scheduling error translates into an immediate productivity loss for receptionists.</p><p><strong>Package billing against the grain:</strong> The standard model for management software invoices as services are delivered. Driving schools collect the full package amount upfront at enrollment — something few tools handle natively.</p><p><strong>No room to grow:</strong> Closed proprietary database, no API, costly data migration — no way to connect the software to other tools.</p>'
- discriminant: odooExpertise
  value:
    bgClass: white-bg
    title: Our solution for Driving Schools
    items:
    - logo: cloud-servers-icon
      heading: Student management
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Complete student record, from first contact to license obtained.</p><ul><li>Belgian national ID validation and license categories (AM to DE)</li><li>Required documents: ID card, medical certificate, photo</li><li>Progress tracking: hours completed, skills acquired</li></ul>'
    - logo: material-icon
      heading: Packages & pricing
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Configurable packages by number of driving hours and theory sessions.</p><ul><li>Promotional packages and installment payments</li><li>Automatic package validity and expiry</li><li>Additional hours purchasable individually</li></ul>'
    - logo: monitoring-icon
      heading: Real-time scheduling
      descriptionPoints: '<p>The core of the system: multi-instructor timeline view with drag & drop.</p><ul><li>Automatic conflict detection (instructor, vehicle)</li><li>Instant sync across every workstation</li><li>Automatic suggestion of available slots</li></ul>'
    - logo: network-icon
      heading: Instructors & fleet
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Availability, leave and assigned vehicles in one place.</p><ul><li>Mileage, fuel and maintenance tracking</li><li>Statistics: hours taught, pass rate</li></ul>'
    - logo: python-icon
      heading: Belgian invoicing & payments
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Invoicing immediately at enrollment, matching how the sector actually works.</p><ul><li>Belgian VAT, SEPA, Bancontact, card payments</li><li>Automatic reminders and installment plans</li></ul>'
    - logo: offer-icon
      heading: Exams & communication
      descriptionPoints: '<p>Scheduling of theory and practical exams.</p><ul><li>Database of Belgian exam centers</li><li>Automatic emails and notifications to students</li></ul>'
